<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - National Data started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - National Data started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonald &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of National Data Corp with an aggressive buy rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $1.38 per share for 1997 and $1.75 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $53.</p>
<p>-- shares up 2-1/8 to 41-5/8.</p>
</text>
